# assets/audio/voice/ IS committed (needed for the static Cloudflare Pages
# deploy — nothing in the build step generates it, see wrangler.jsonc). Files
# are produced locally by `npm run voiceover` (tools/voiceover-gen.mjs) using
# FISH_AUDIO_API_KEY in .env, then committed like any other asset.
